	(gr_text "the mod matrix:\n- the 3.5mm sockets DO NOT send CV signal. this is configured as a button \n  matrix to simulate the modular experience.\n- the centred sockets are the modulation inputs. the sockets in the adjacent \n  corners are the outputs.\n- there are 4 modulation sources: sequencer, envelope generator, pulsar \n  and the random voltage source.\n\n"
